                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i s\u1EBD kh\u00F4ng bao gi\u1EDD l\u00E0m v\u1EADy."
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "description",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Ai t\u1EF1 x\u01B0ng l\u00E0 website n\u00E0y m\u00E0 l\u00E0m m\u1ED9t trong b\u1ED1n vi\u1EC7c n\u00E0y, \u0111\u00F3 kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i. N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n g\u1EEDi c\u00E2u h\u1ECFi v\u00E0 mu\u1ED1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi, ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i ch\u1EC9 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi \u0111\u00FAng c\u00E2u h\u1ECFi \u0111\u00F3."
